== Walkthrough ==

'''Find [[Roesager Thusten]] in [[North Qeynos]] at loc -127.82, -115.97, 3.13'''  ''(Optional)''

You say, 'Hail, Roesager Thusten'

: Roesager Thusten says 'Hail, ______! My name is Roesager Thusten, Paladin of Life. I am a loyal servant of the Prime Healer and I seek to destroy all who wish to bring death and disease to the land of Norrath.' 

You say, 'Who brings disease?'

: Roesager Thusten says 'The Plaguebringers are followers of the disease lord, Bertoxxulous. We believe a sect of them now operates in Qeynos, but we need proof before we can act.'

You say, 'Who is Bertoxxulous?'

: Roesager Thusten says 'Bertoxxulous is a vile creature who rules the Plane of Disease. His filthy followers are spreading their stain across all of Norrath. We fear they are already here in Qeynos.'

You say, 'What Plaguebringers?'

: Roesager Thusten says 'The Plaguebringers are followers of the disease lord, Bertoxxulous. We believe a sect of them now operates in Qeynos, but we need proof before we can act.'

You say, 'What proof?'

: Roesager Thusten says 'Someone reported seeing a Plaguebringer roaming about in the hills near Qeynos. We have long suspected that their dark influence was spreading. I am searching for proof that they are now here in Qeynos. If you find anything, please bring it to me at the Temple of Life.'

'''This quest uses [[Gharin's Note (evil)]] or [[Gharin's Note (Good)]] as a sub-quest; you can either give Gharin's real or fake note.'''

'''Go to South Qeynos and find [[Gharin]] (at Dubious Guards of Qeynos, Gharin will NOT TALK to you, but he will still take the Brew).'''

You say, 'Hail, Gharin'

: Gharin says 'Good day! I see they have good stock for the future armies of Qeynos. I, myself, wish to be a soldier one day instead of doing this [job].'

You say, 'What job?'

: Gharin says 'I am a [messenger] for Antonius Bayle. Not big enough to fight, but light enough to run all the way to the [Jaggedpine] tomorrow morning. I sort of wish I did not have to go. I'd rather be at the Lion's Mane.'

You say, 'Where is the Jaggedpine?'

: Gharin says 'I will be taking a private note to the head druid of the Jaggedpine Treefolk. Matter of fact, I am carrying the note right now. But enough about that, if it were not for the mission tomorrow, I could be doing something at the [Lion's Mane].'

You say, 'What is the Lion's Mane?'

: Gharin says 'Ahh. The Lion's Mane. If I were there, I would be enjoying a stein of Crow's [special brew]. They are expecting their first shipment of the brew. I believe if I had a few or more of those lagers, I would be very ill. I would probably have to have someone else deliver the note for me. Still, I wish I had one of those fine brews.'

'''Hand four [[Crows Special Brew]] to Gharin.'''

'''''Note: There are two kinds of Crow's Special Brew in the game. [[Crow's Special Brew]] with an ' Apostrophe in the name that comes from Tattered Pouch quest will not be accepted by Gharin.<br>  The correct kind [[Crows Special Brew]] is purchased from [[Crow]] himself but this is a limited supply item (20). Once he sells out, its all gone until a server restart or respawned by killing him.'''''

:Gharin says 'Oohhh! My head. Stop the pub from spinning. I cannot make it to the Jaggedpine feeling like this. Please take this note to Te'Anara of the Treefolk. Here is a little silver for the favor. Thanks. Ooohhhh..'

