'''You receive A Sealed Letter (identifies as "Note To Jaggedpine"). It reads:'''

 Te'Anara, I have spoken to the merchants guild of Qeynos.
 We have agreed to increase the tax on all bearskins.
 The Qeynos Guard shall also be apprehending all known poachers for extradition to the Jaggedpine.
 Signed, Antonius Bayle

'''Go to the [[Surefall Glade]] and find [[Te'Anara]] right next to the port-in spot''' ''(Optional)''<br>
'''''Note: This step is no longer required to trigger [[Tovax Vmar]] who now spawns nightly'''''

You say, 'Hail, TeAnara'

: TeAnara says 'Welcome, friend! I hope your stay in Surefall Glade will ease your mind and soothe your soul. While you are here, we ask you to abide by the [laws of the Jaggedpine].'

'''Give her the letter.'''

TeAnara says 'Aye! This is good news. We shall try to supply Qeynos with a limited number of acres to begin their lumberyard. Here, my good messenger. A token to share in the good news.'
<div class="facblock">
